# Applied on top of go-mod-overrides, only when building Kubernetes v1.33.x.
#
# go.opentelemetry.io/contrib/.../otelgrpc: Kubernetes 1.33 still calls otelgrpc.UnaryClientInterceptor and
# otelgrpc.StreamClientInterceptor (apiserver storagebackend/factory/etcd3.go). Those were removed in otelgrpc
# v0.61.0 and v0.63.0. The grpc v1.83.2 override pulls in cloud.google.com/go/auth v0.18.2, which requires
# otelgrpc >= v0.61.0, so module resolution moves past the version 1.33 needs. Hold it at the upstream 1.33 pin.
# This change is exclusive for 1.33, drop this once 1.33 is no longer built.
-replace go.opentelemetry.io/contrib/instrumentation/google.golang.org/grpc/otelgrpc=go.opentelemetry.io/contrib/instrumentation/google.golang.org/grpc/otelgrpc@v0.58.0
